WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Stinging, tight, flaking —
your skin isn't sensitive.

2
00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:04.200
It's a broken barrier.

3
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.400
What actually broke:
every acid, every day.

4
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.600
The barrier stops
holding water in.

5
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.500
The fix: stop the acids.
Two weeks.

6
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.400
Start cica —
morning and night.

7
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.000
Cica, Centella and
tiger grass are one plant.
